, I trigger a build again because I cannot differentiate an old build from a new in my terminal.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> Updated my PR following @Calinou's suggestion.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- New build option: \r\n  - ``build_timestamp_timezone: Determines which timezone to use to print build timestamps in SCons terminal output. Defaults to `utc` (utc|system)``\r\n- Uses `datetime` for all timestamp calculation (including the build time)\r\n\r\n### Start of the build\r\n#### Plain text\r\n```plain\r\n❯ scons\r\nscons: Reading SConscript files ...\r\nINFO: (build started at 2026-01-08 20:02:16 UTC)\r\n```\r\n#### Picture\r\n<img width=\"434\" height=\"131\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2026-01-08 à 15 02 44\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83688fa0-02d3-432f-8a6c-c6c8d3a81bb7\" />\r\n\r\n### End of the build\r\n#### Plain text\r\n```plain\r\n[100%] scons: done building targets.\r\nINFO: Time elapsed: 0:00:14.90 (build ended at 2026-01-08 20:02:31 UTC)\r\n```\r\n#### Picture\r\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"109\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2026-01-08 à 15 05 08\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f32c3745-fca9-4d77-83ca-14e12a8116ae\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.